From 384183cf4a4be5b9f3c873791d3bcf0efac8355d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 00:29:05 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(app): machine and post lists follow their folders

The machine list and the post list came from fixed tables. A file that
was added to the folder did not show. A removed file left an entry that
gave a file-not-found error. The lists now come from a scan of the
folder. Refresh scans again. A table name whose file is missing is still
refused by name when a document needs it.

Fixes #2380

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
